      "originalText": "GET /state      valid LiveState, sorted, 6 h window\nboot            hello, then snapshot or deltas; seqs consecutive\nresume          drop, ?since=n -> exactly n+1 ...\ntoo old         ?since=0 -> snapshot          resync -> snapshot\nalert           test alert < 1 s, appears in state.alerts\nhistory/events  shape, snapping, 7-day limit, filters\nsecurity        /mock/* 404 and bad Origin refused (Worker only)",
